body: "Origin: [pm-rl-sequential](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/blob/main/.agents/pm/features/pm-rl-sequential.toon). The orchestrator accepted validateEvaluationOrder, its 17 creation-order cases and function-only revert proofs as sufficient for [PR107](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/107). This Feature owns the separate lifecycle API migration and clock-independent ordering proof; it does not block PR107."
